      "text": "[6:37PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Oyebanji intersection to Police Post via Oba's Palace along Adeniji Adele Road, traffic is moving smoothly. \nHowever, there's a flash flood at John Street junction, causing slow movement from underneath the Idumota pedestrian bridge down to Eyin Eyo, connecting Balogun and Martins Streets. \nMeanwhile, the route from Tinubu Square to Nnamdi Azikiwe Street, enroute to Carter Bridge via Tom Jones intersection, is reporting normal traffic flow. \nDrivers are advised to exercise caution and consider alternative routes to minimize delays.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
